# Place yt-dlp.exe and ffmpeg.exe here.
# They are NOT committed to git (see .gitignore).
# Run `scripts/bootstrap.ps1` from the repo root to fetch them automatically,
# or download them manually from:
#   - https://github.com/yt-dlp/yt-dlp/releases/latest
#   - https://www.gyan.dev/ffmpeg/builds/   (or  https://github.com/BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds/releases)
#
# On first launch, the app will copy whatever is present here into
# %LocalAppData%\yt-mdlp\bin\ if it is not already provisioned there.
